# MealRelay Web Environment Configuration
# ----------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: MealRelay works 100% out-of-the-box in Demo Mode!
# No environment variables or external database setup are required to run locally.
#
# If you want to connect to a live Supabase PostgreSQL database:
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL schema from: packages/api/schema.sql in the Supabase SQL editor
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your Supabase credentials below:

# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
